Control of water balance is now a simple and fascinating occupation. You will always know when to drink a glass of water. Keep the body in good shape.

Features:
- Daily notifications will remind you to replenish the water balance;
- Synchronization with Apple Health allows you to fully control information about your body;
- Add data about the drunk liquid using Apple Watch;
- Automatic calculation of the amount of water;
- 19 types of beverages with their own efficiency coefficient, allow more accurate determination of the amount of liquid consumed;
- Works without an Internet connection;
- Look at the daily statistics of the liquid.

Start looking after your health right now!
